{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/129063-changeling-the-dreaming-\u201ccommoner\u201d-houses","id":129063,"title":"[Changeling: The Dreaming] \u201cCommoner\u201d Houses","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-05-09T10:16:25-07:00","id":129063,"title":"[Changeling: The Dreaming] \u201cCommoner\u201d Houses","content":"<span style=\"font-family:courier new\">An old troupe-mate and I are getting together and, for larfs, we\u2019re going to muck about with some homebrew rules for CtD. The haphazard goal is to fiddle with some of the mechanics, but I was thinking of messing with the setting slightly.<br /> <br /> In this ad-hoc-ish setting rehash, I\u2019m going to use some of the Houses as predominantly occupied by commoner kiths in an attempt to play up on \u2018commoner vs. noble\u2019 rather than \u2018commoner vs. sidhe.\u2019 During the Resurgence, the sidhe still returned, along with the noble Houses (except Scathatch, because Ninjas!). In this setting, however, not all the noble Houses are governed by sidhe.<br /> <br /> Here\u2019s what I was thinking [Admittedly, some of these are slightly pigeon-holed; don\u2019t judge me too harshly]:<br /> <br /> Boggans: House Liam<br /> <br /> Nockers: House Dougal (which is obvious, I suppose)<br /> <br /> Sluagh: House Eiluned<br /> <br /> Redcaps: House Balor<br /> <br /> Satyrs: House Fiona (?)<br /> <br /> Trolls: House Aesin<br /> <br /> Eshu: House Beaumayan (?)<br /> <br /> Pooka: House Daireann (?)<br /> <br /> Which still leaves Gwydion, Ailil, Leanhaun, Varich [, and Scathatch] as sidhe-governed Houses. I\u2019m curious to see if this hack will help mitigate the perception of sidhe having a political monopoly, replacing it with a perception of political majority. <br /> <br /> Thoughts? <br /> Better suggestions for House placements?<br /> <br /> [Obligatory Disclaimer: I\u2019m not suggesting fixes; it\u2019s just homebrew. Well, in this case, it\u2019s Housebrew\u2026]</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:8px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">&lt;signature&gt; something witty &lt;/signature&gt;</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/302-nazfool","name":"Nazfool","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar302_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"753"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}